# Check out text files with LF line endings on every platform,
# also where Git converts them to CRLF by default, e.g. on GitHub's Windows runners.
# The examples in tests/ compare file digests and sizes with expected outputs,
# and the shell scripts in the repository do not tolerate a carriage return.
* text=auto eol=lf
